+## Code review
+
+- Name each finding's class of bug, the general mistake and not the one line, and list every other place in the repository that makes it, so the author fixes them all.
+- On a bug fix, state the bug's root cause and check that the diff removes it, not only the symptom. A fix that leaves the root cause in place is a finding.
